# Jejakawan (`ja-control-plane`) — aturan agen

## Wajib pertama

1. Baca **`docs/AGENT_START_HERE.md`** dan **`docs/.agent-rules.md`** sebelum implementasi.
2. Hub domain: **`docs/architecture/hub-domain-and-module-tiers.md`** · scope: **`docs/architecture/request-scope.md`**.

## Istilah hub (jangan campur)

| Pakai | Jangan untuk kode baru di hub |
| :--- | :--- |
| **subscription** (`platform_subscriptions`, `HubSubscriptionScope`) | workspace, tenant, `saas_*` |
| **customer**, **product**, **package** | `saas_tenant` |
| **organization** (CMS di produk lain) | `subscription_id` di kolom konten hub |

## Kode & API (singkat)

- Middleware: `subscription.feature:{key}` · member: `X-Subscription-Domain` · hub CMS: global (`ScopedToHubSite`, no org header)
- Admin API: `/api/v1/manage/platform/*` · webhooks: `/api/v1/platform/webhooks/*`
- FE konsol: `/dash/platform`
- **Tidak ada** provisioning DB per tenant di repo ini (single DB hub)

## Lingkup git & direktori

- **Hanya** `/opt/ja-control-plane` — remote `jejak-awan/ja-control-plane`, branch kerja `dev`.
- **`/opt/ja-workspace` bukan repo git hub** (tidak ada `.git` di sana). Jangan commit, push, atau refactor di path itu kecuali user secara eksplisit meminta produk workspace.
- Runbook CMS multi-DB / SaaS tenant → clone produk terpisah nanti; di hub cukup [moved-to-ja-workspace.md](../../docs/moved-to-ja-workspace.md).

## Produk

- Repo ini: **control plane** (`APP_ROLE=ops`). CMS hosted → repositori produk terpisah (`ja-workspace`, di luar git hub).
